<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>MG 금융사기 예방 체험관</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --mg-blue: #0068b7;
      --mg-blue-dark: #004f8b;
      --mg-blue-light: #eaf5fd;

      --green: #12a36d;
      --green-light: #eaf8f2;

      --yellow: #f4b740;
      --yellow-light: #fff7df;

      --red: #e04d5d;
      --red-light: #fff0f2;

      --bg: #f3f6f9;
      --white: #ffffff;

      --text: #172230;
      --sub: #657588;
      --line: #dfe7ee;

      --radius-lg: 22px;
      --radius-md: 14px;

      --shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(26, 58, 88, 0.08);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family:
        Pretendard,
        "Noto Sans KR",
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;

      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    button {
      font: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .header {
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 80% 20%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.12),
          transparent 30%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--mg-blue-dark),
          var(--mg-blue)
        );

      color: white;
      padding: 28px 20px 70px;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .brand-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      gap: 11px;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: white;
      color: var(--mg-blue);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .safe-badge {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.13);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero {
      margin-top: 40px;
      max-width: 690px;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;

      background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);

      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 7px 12px;

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;

      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 46px);
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: -38px auto 60px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .overview-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .overview-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 17px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(217,226,234,.9);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .overview-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      background: var(--mg-blue-light);
      color: var(--mg-blue);

      font-size: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .overview-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .overview-text {
      color: var(--sub);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .main-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .panel {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(217,226,234,.9);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .quiz-panel {
      padding: 27px;
    }

    .quiz-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .quiz-progress-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--mg-blue);
    }

    .score-pill {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: #37617f;
      background: #eef5f9;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .progress {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #e9eef2;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--mg-blue),
        #25a1dc
      );
      transition: width .3s ease;
    }

    .scenario-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 9px;
      border-radius: 8px;

      background: var(--red-light);
      color: var(--red);

      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 11px;
    }

    .question-title {
      font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 28px);
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .scenario-box {
      margin-top: 20px;

      background: #f7f9fb;
      border: 1px solid #e2e9ef;
      border-radius: 15px;

      padding: 18px;
    }

    .scenario-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--sub);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .scenario-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #34465a;
    }

    .message-card {
      margin-top: 13px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #dce5ec;
      border-radius: 13px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .message-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;

      padding: 10px 13px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e7edf2;

      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--sub);
    }

    .message-body {
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .fake-link {
      color: var(--mg-blue);
      text-decoration: underline;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .answers {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .answer-btn {
      width: 100%;

      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      border-radius: 13px;

      padding: 16px;
      text-align: left;

      color: #3a4c60;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;

      transition: .18s;
    }

    .answer-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--mg-blue);
      background: var(--mg-blue-light);
      color: var(--mg-blue);
    }

    .answer-btn.correct {
      border-color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
      color: #19704f;
    }

    .answer-btn.wrong {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-light);
      color: #a93946;
    }

    .answer-btn:disabled {
      cursor: default;
    }

    .feedback {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 20px;

      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 17px;
    }

    .feedback.correct {
      display: block;
      background: var(--green-light);
      border: 1px solid #bce8d5;
      color: #286c52;
    }

    .feedback.wrong {
      display: block;
      background: var(--red-light);
      border: 1px solid #f1c9ce;
      color: #8d3741;
    }

    .feedback-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .feedback-text {
      margin-top: 7px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .warning-signals {
      margin-top: 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .warning-chip {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      border-radius: 7px;

      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .next-btn {
      display: none;

      width: 100%;
      height: 52px;

      margin-top: 18px;

      border: none;
      border-radius: 13px;

      background: var(--mg-blue);
      color: white;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .next-btn.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .side-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .side-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(217,226,234,.9);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .side-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .danger-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .danger-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: flex-start;

      background: #f7f9fb;
      border-radius: 11px;
      padding: 11px;
    }

    .danger-number {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      flex-shrink: 0;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--red-light);
      color: var(--red);

      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .danger-item strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .danger-item p {
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--sub);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .emergency {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #fff8e2,
          #fffdf7
        );

      border: 1px solid #f3dfab;
    }

    .emergency-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #795d19;
    }

    .emergency p {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #7a6b45;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .emergency-actions {
      display: grid;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-top: 13px;
    }

    .emergency-action {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #665a3b;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .result-screen {
      display: none;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px 5px;
    }

    .result-screen.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .result-icon {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;

      margin: 10px auto 18px;

      border-radius: 50%;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      font-size: 42px;

      background: var(--mg-blue-light);
    }

    .result-grade {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .result-score {
      color: var(--mg-blue);
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .result-desc {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 13px auto 0;

      color: var(--sub);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .result-stat {
      max-width: 470px;
      margin: 25px auto 0;

      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .stat-box {
      padding: 14px 8px;
      background: #f7f9fb;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: var(--mg-blue);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--sub);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .result-tip {
      margin: 23px auto 0;
      max-width: 520px;
      text-align: left;

      padding: 17px;
      border-radius: 14px;

      background: #f5f9fc;
      border: 1px solid #dce9f2;
    }

    .result-tip strong {
      color: var(--mg-blue);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .result-tip ul {
      margin: 9px 0 0 18px;
      color: #53677a;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .restart-btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      height: 52px;

      border: none;
      border-radius: 13px;

      background: var(--mg-blue);
      color: white;

      font-weight: 900;
      margin-top: 23px;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 15px 18px;

      background: #f7f9fb;
      border-radius: 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);

      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--sub);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .main-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .overview-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .side-column {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .header {
        padding-left: 16px;
        padding-right: 16px;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 0 12px;
      }

      .safe-badge {
        display: none;
      }

      .quiz-panel {
        padding: 20px 16px;
      }

      .side-column {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .result-stat {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="header">
  <div class="header-inner">

    <div class="brand-row">

      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-logo">MG</div>

        <div>
          새마을금고
          <div
            style="
              font-size:11px;
              font-weight:500;
              opacity:.7;
            "
          >
            안전한 금융생활
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="safe-badge">
        금융사기 예방 체험 콘텐츠
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hero">

      <div class="hero-tag">
        🛡️ 금융사기 예방 프로젝트
      </div>

      <h1>
        당신이라면<br>
        이 상황에서 어떻게 하시겠어요?
      </h1>

      <p>
        보이스피싱과 스미싱은 누구에게나 발생할 수 있습니다.
        실제와 유사한 상황을 체험하며 금융사기의 위험 신호를
        확인해보세요.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <section class="overview-grid">

    <div class="overview-card">
      <div class="overview-icon">📱</div>
      <div class="overview-title">
        상황형 체험
      </div>
      <div class="overview-text">
        문자·전화·메신저 등 다양한 금융사기 상황을 직접 판단합니다.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="overview-card">
      <div class="overview-icon">🔍</div>
      <div class="overview-title">
        위험 신호 확인
      </div>
      <div class="overview-text">
        사기 상황에서 발견할 수 있는 대표적인 위험 신호를 안내합니다.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="overview-card">
      <div class="overview-icon">🏆</div>
      <div class="overview-title">
        안전지수 측정
      </div>
      <div class="overview-text">
        퀴즈 결과를 바탕으로 금융사기 대응 수준을 확인할 수 있습니다.
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <div class="main-grid">

    <section class="panel quiz-panel">

      <!-- 퀴즈 화면 -->
      <div id="quizScreen">

        <div class="quiz-top">
          <div
            class="quiz-progress-label"
            id="progressLabel"
          >
            상황 1 / 5
          </div>

          <div
            class="score-pill"
            id="scoreDisplay"
          >
            현재 점수 0점
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="progress">
          <div
            class="progress-bar"
            id="progressBar"
          ></div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="scenario-badge"
          id="scenarioType"
        >
          스미싱 의심 상황
        </div>

        <h2
          class="question-title"
          id="questionTitle"
        ></h2>

        <div
          class="scenario-box"
          id="scenarioBox"
        ></div>

        <div
          class="answers"
          id="answers"
        ></div>

        <div
          class="feedback"
          id="feedback"
        >

          <div
            class="feedback-title"
            id="feedbackTitle"
          ></div>

          <div
            class="feedback-text"
            id="feedbackText"
          ></div>

          <div
            class="warning-signals"
            id="warningSignals"
          ></div>

        </div>

        <button
          class="next-btn"
          id="nextBtn"
        >
          다음 상황으로
        </button>

      </div>

      <!-- 결과 화면 -->
      <div
        class="result-screen"
        id="resultScreen"
      >

        <div
          class="result-icon"
          id="resultIcon"
        >
          🛡️
        </div>

        <div
          class="result-grade"
          id="resultGrade"
        ></div>

        <div
          class="result-score"
          id="resultScore"
        ></div>

        <div
          class="result-desc"
          id="resultDesc"
        ></div>

        <div class="result-stat">

          <div class="stat-box">
            <div
              class="stat-number"
              id="correctCount"
            >
              0
            </div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              올바른 판단
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-box">
            <div
              class="stat-number"
              id="wrongCount"
            >
              0
            </div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              주의 필요
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-box">
            <div
              class="stat-number"
              id="safePercent"
            >
              0%
            </div>
            <div class="stat-label">
              안전지수
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="result-tip">

          <strong>
            금융사기 예방 3가지 원칙
          </strong>

          <ul>
            <li>
              출처가 불분명한 링크나 앱은 실행하지 않습니다.
            </li>

            <li>
              금융기관·수사기관을 사칭하며 송금을 요구하면
              먼저 의심합니다.
            </li>

            <li>
              가족이나 지인의 긴급 송금 요청도 직접 연락해
              사실 여부를 확인합니다.
            </li>
          </ul>

        </div>

        <button
          class="restart-btn"
          id="restartBtn"
        >
          다시 체험하기
        </button>

      </div>

      <div class="footer-note">
        ※ 본 콘텐츠는 금융사기 예방 교육을 위한 예시이며
        실제 금융기관·기관의 공식 연락 여부는 해당 기관의
        공식 채널을 통해 별도로 확인하시기 바랍니다.
      </div>

    </section>

    <aside class="side-column">

      <section class="side-card">

        <h3 class="side-title">
          🚨 이런 말이 나오면 의심하세요
        </h3>

        <div class="danger-list">

          <div class="danger-item">
            <div class="danger-number">1</div>
            <div>
              <strong>
                "지금 바로 송금하세요"
              </strong>
              <p>
                판단할 시간을 주지 않고 긴급함을 강조합니다.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="danger-item">
            <div class="danger-number">2</div>
            <div>
              <strong>
                "안전계좌로 보내세요"
              </strong>
              <p>
                자금 보호를 이유로 계좌이체를 유도합니다.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="danger-item">
            <div class="danger-number">3</div>
            <div>
              <strong>
                "이 앱을 설치하세요"
              </strong>
              <p>
                출처가 확인되지 않은 앱 설치를 요구합니다.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="danger-item">
            <div class="danger-number">4</div>
            <div>
              <strong>
                "다른 사람에게 말하지 마세요"
              </strong>
              <p>
                주변의 확인과 도움을 차단하려는 대표적인 수법입니다.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <section class="side-card emergency">

        <div class="emergency-title">
          이미 송금했다면?
        </div>

        <p>
